# The runtime image of web-request-cost (harness/stack/Dockerfile.runtime at afd7ea6, built by build.sh as
# blog-runtime:<Ubuntu version>; it provides libpq5 and PgBouncer from Ubuntu) plus the libraries of ext/gd.
ARG UBUNTU=26.04
FROM blog-runtime:${UBUNTU}
RUN apt-get update && DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends libpng16-16t64 libfreetype6 \
	&& rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
